<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { titulo: titulo }) %>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-neutral-800 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 font-sans">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main id="contenido">
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-primary-950">
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-1/2 hidden lg:block" data-ripple data-ripple-image="/img/call-center.jpg">
        <img src="/img/call-center.jpg" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"
             class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center">
        <canvas class="dc-ripple-canvas" hidden aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-950 via-primary-950/55 to-primary-950/85"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle,#ffffff 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:24px 24px;opacity:0.05" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] gap-8 lg:gap-14 items-center">
          <form id="contacto-form" class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl shadow-primary-950/40 p-4 sm:p-7 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 w-full min-w-0">
            <div class="sm:col-span-2 min-w-0">
              <h2 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-slate-100 break-words">Cuéntanos qué necesitas</h2>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5 break-words">Te respondemos por email.</p>
            </div>
            <input name="nombre" required placeholder="Tu nombre" aria-label="Tu nombre" autocomplete="name" class="h-11 px-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-slate-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-600 text-neutral-900 dark:text-slate-100 placeholder:text-neutral-600 dark:placeholder:text-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-600 dark:focus:ring-primary-500 w-full min-w-0">
            <input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="Tu email" aria-label="Tu email" autocomplete="email" class="h-11 px-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-slate-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-600 text-neutral-900 dark:text-slate-100 placeholder:text-neutral-600 dark:placeholder:text-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-600 dark:focus:ring-primary-500 w-full min-w-0">
            <input name="telefono" type="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="Teléfono (opcional)" aria-label="Teléfono" autocomplete="tel" class="sm:col-span-2 h-11 px-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-slate-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-600 text-neutral-900 dark:text-slate-100 placeholder:text-neutral-600 dark:placeholder:text-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-600 dark:focus:ring-primary-500 w-full min-w-0">
            <textarea name="mensaje" required rows="5" placeholder="Escribe tu mensaje..." aria-label="Mensaje" class="sm:col-span-2 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-slate-700 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-slate-600 text-neutral-900 dark:text-slate-100 placeholder:text-neutral-600 dark:placeholder:text-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-600 dark:focus:ring-primary-500 w-full min-w-0 resize-y"></textarea>
            <div class="sm:col-span-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <button type="submit" class="px-6 h-11 grid place-items-center rounded-xl bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white font-bold transition-colors whitespace-nowrap">Enviar mensaje</button>
              <span id="contacto-msg" class="text-sm break-words" role="status"></span>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div class="drop-shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]">
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-accent-400">Asistencia 24/7</p>
            <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Contáctanos</h1>
            <p class="mt-4 text-white leading-relaxed">¿Quieres publicar tu empresa o necesitas ayuda? Escríbenos y te responderemos a la brevedad.</p>

            <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-white font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="grid place-items-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-success-500/30 text-success-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg></span>
                Publica fotos, datos de contacto y ubicación en el mapa.
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="grid place-items-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-success-500/30 text-success-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg></span>
                Aparece en las búsquedas por categoría y ciudad.
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="grid place-items-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-success-500/30 text-success-200 shrink-0 mt-0.5"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg></span>
                Promoción local, nacional e internacional.
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur p-5">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/80 mb-2">Servicio al cliente</p>
              <a href="mailto:introduccion@Midirectoriocerca.co" class="font-semibold text-white hover:text-accent-300 transition-colors break-all">introduccion@Midirectoriocerca.co</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/index.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/ripple.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
